# Drift reports are derived data — regenerated on every /doc-sync run, and once
# the new snapshot is committed `git show` says the same thing. The snapshot
# itself (doc-snapshot/pages/ and manifest.json) IS committed; it is the
# baseline every diff is taken against.
doc-snapshot/reports/
